10
00:44:22,500 --> 00:44:28,500
Once Upon a Forest is a 1993 animated adventure film produced by
Hanna-Barbera and distributed by 20th Century Fox.

11
00:48:48,750 --> 00:48:54,750
Based on the Furlings characters created by Rae Lambert, the film was directed by Charles Grosvenor and
produced by David Kirschner, and stars the voices of Michael Crawford and Ben Vereen.

12
00:53:15,000 --> 00:53:21,000
The film is about a trio of "Furlings" – the story's term for young anthropomorphic
animals – who go on an expedition to find a cure for their poisoned friend.

13
00:57:41,250 --> 00:57:47,250
The film's environmental theme divided critics at the time of
its release, along with the animation and story.

14
01:02:07,500 --> 01:02:13,500
The film grossed $6.6 million in the US against a budget of $13–16 million.

15
01:06:33,750 --> 01:06:39,750
The film explores themes of friendship, animals, quest.
